### Variables
@host = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### List tasks
GET {{host}}/tasks

### Create a task
POST {{host}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write Day 2 summary",
  "description": "Document what we shipped today",
  "status": "todo"
}

### Get one task
GET {{host}}/tasks/1

### Update a task
PUT {{host}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### Delete a task
DELETE {{host}}/tasks/1
